### Test Comment Like Implementation

### 1. Get JWT Token (Login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("jwtToken", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 2. Create a Forum Thread (if needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/forum-threads
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Thread for Comment Likes",
  "description": "This is a test thread to demonstrate comment likes functionality",
  "categoryId": "your-category-id-here"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("threadId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. Create a Comment in the Thread
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/forum/create-comment
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{threadId}}",
  "content": "This is a test comment to like"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("commentId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 4. Like the Comment (First Click)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/forum/comment/{{commentId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Comment like toggled successfully",
#   "data": {
#     "id": "comment-uuid",
#     "content": "This is a test comment to like",
#     "threadId": "thread-uuid",
#     "authorId": 123,
#     "parentId": null,
#     "createdAt": "2025-10-22T14:27:44.000Z",
#     "updatedAt": "2025-10-22T14:27:44.000Z",
#     "isAnonymous": false,
#     "likeCount": 1,  // Should be 1 after first like
#     "dislikeCount": 0,
#     "author": {
#       "id": 123,
#       "name": "User Name",
#       "profileImage": "image-url"
#     },
#     "_count": {
#       "replies": 0
#     },
#     "isLiked": true  // Should be true after liking
#   }
# }

### 5. Get Forum Thread with Comments (Verify like count is included)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/forum-threads/{{threadId}}

### Expected Response should include:
# - forum_comments array with likeCount field
# - Each comment should have its likeCount displayed

### 6. Unlike the Comment (Second Click)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/forum/comment/{{commentId}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "message": "Comment like toggled successfully",
