### 8. Test Multiple Users Liking the Same Comment
# (This would require multiple user accounts and tokens)

### Summary of Implementation:
# ✅ Comment likes are stored in the forum_comment_likes table
# ✅ Each user can only like a comment once (unique constraint)
# ✅ Toggle functionality works (like/unlike)
# ✅ Like count is properly incremented/decremented
# ✅ isLiked flag is returned to indicate current user's like status
# ✅ Forum thread data includes comment like counts when fetched
